# Local First (no cloud agents)

Owner order (2026-07-24): **do all work on the laptop**. Do not launch Cursor Cloud Agents.

## How to work

- Use **local Agent / IDE only** in this repo on the Windows laptop.
- Do **not** start cloud agents, cloud branches, or `cursor.com/agents` workflows unless the owner explicitly reverses this.
- Run PHP + MariaDB locally (`dev_local` bootstrap + `php -S localhost:8000`).
- Chat replies to the user may be Hindi; all product/UI text stays English.

## Do not

- Do not delete production pages or run broad remote deletes.
- Do not invent or commit credentials (`config.php`, `.vscode/sftp.json`, API keys).
- Do not force-push or hard-reset unless the user explicitly asks.
- Do not open cloud agent sessions for UniWeb work.
